  "document": "12 Years a Slave (score)\n12 Years a Slave is the original soundtrack album to the 2013 film \"12 Years a Slave\" starring Chiwetel Ejiofor, Michael Fassbender, Benedict Cumberbatch, Paul Dano, and Lupita Nyong'o. The record contains twenty-one tracks from the original film score written and composed by Hans Zimmer. The score was widely admired and thought of as a contender for the Academy Award for Original Music Score at the 86th Academy Awards."
